@startuml frame_loop_sequence
title Frame loop: variable frame rate driving the fixed 1 kHz simulation
autonumber
participant "Front end" as Frontend
participant "FixedStepClock" as Clock
participant "simulation step\n(today: engine::step)" as Sim

note over Frontend : The front end (later the Godot GDExtension)\nowns the clock and the device input.\nThe core never reads time or devices.

loop every rendered frame
  Frontend -> Clock : advance(elapsed_ns)
  Clock --> Frontend : Advance {steps, dropped_ns}\n(steps <= max_steps_per_advance)
  loop steps times
    Frontend -> Sim : step(state, params, input, step_s = 0.001)
    Sim --> Frontend : output
  end
  Frontend -> Clock : alpha()
  Clock --> Frontend : 0 <= alpha < 1
  Frontend -> Frontend : render interpolate(previous_state, state, alpha)
end
@enduml
